#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:2
msgid "Amazon ALB"
msgstr "Amazon ALB"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:5
msgid "Add Amazon ALB Load Balancer"
msgstr "Amazon-ALB-Load-Balancer hinzufügen"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:7
msgid "To add an Amazon ALB (Application Load Balancer) Integration:"
msgstr "So fügen Sie eine Amazon-ALB-(Application-Load-Balancer-)Integration hinzu:"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:9
msgid "Navigate to :menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Load Balancers`"
msgstr "Navigieren Sie zu :menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Load Balancers`"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:10
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`+ ADD` auswählen"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select **Amazon ALB** from the drop-down list. The NEW LOAD BALANCER "
"panel opens."
msgstr "**Amazon ALB** aus der Dropdown-Liste auswählen. Das Panel NEW LOAD BALANCER öffnet sich."

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:12
msgid "Configure the following:"
msgstr "Konfigurieren Sie Folgendes:"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:14
msgid "GROUP"
msgstr "GROUP"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:15
msgid "From the drop-down list, select the group for the load balancer."
msgstr "Wählen Sie aus der Dropdown-Liste die Gruppe für den Load Balancer."

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:16
msgid "CLOUD"
msgstr "CLOUD"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:17
msgid ""
"From the drop-down list, select the Amazon cloud that hosts the load "
"balancer."
msgstr "Wählen Sie aus der Dropdown-Liste die Amazon-Cloud, die den Load Balancer hostet."

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:18
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:19
msgid "Enter the load balancer name."
msgstr "Geben Sie den Namen des Load Balancers ein."

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:20
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:21
msgid "Identifying information displayed on the load balancer list page."
msgstr "Identifizierende Informationen, die auf der Load-Balancer-Listenseite angezeigt werden."

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:22
msgid "VISIBILITY"
msgstr "VISIBILITY"

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:23
msgid "Define Multi-Tenant permissions."
msgstr "Multi-Tenant-Berechtigungen festlegen."

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/AmazonALB.rst:25
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."
msgstr "Klicken Sie auf :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."

